00:36:01.960 --> 00:36:03.110
apakah kita sudah selesai?

00:36:03.110 --> 00:36:04.070
Bisakah dia pergi sekarang?

00:36:04.070 --> 00:36:04.710
Azhen,

00:36:04.920 --> 00:36:06.380
Kita hampir selesai berbicara.

00:36:06.480 --> 00:36:07.880
Bawa pulang putrimu.

00:36:07.960 --> 00:36:09.440
Saya akan menghubungi Anda jika terjadi sesuatu.

